# Frozen reference core (verification/reference/ref_core.sv) file list,
# in required compile order (ref_decoder before ref_core, mirroring
# design_files.list's own fsm ordering). One path per line, relative to
# the repo root. Blank lines and #-comments ignored.
#
# The 6 leaf modules the fsm core owns (decoder/alu/c_expand/csr_file/
# divider/register_file) are swapped for their ref_* counterparts under
# verification/reference/; everything else (buses, caches, debug module,
# peripherals, soc.sv itself) is SHARED, unmodified, identical to
# design_files.list -- soc.sv instantiates a module literally named
# `core`, and -DQV_REF_AS_CORE (passed by run_regress.sh/lint.sh's own
# --core ref handling) is what makes ref_core.sv compile AS that name,
# so soc.sv needs no ref-specific variant of its own.
verification/reference/ref_decoder.sv
verification/reference/ref_alu.sv
verification/reference/ref_c_expand.sv
design/cache_complex.sv
design/clint.sv
verification/reference/ref_core.sv
verification/reference/ref_csr_file.sv
design/dcache.sv
verification/reference/ref_divider.sv
design/dm.sv
design/dm_dmi.sv
design/icache.sv
design/jtag_tap.sv
design/plic.sv
verification/reference/ref_register_file.sv
design/soc.sv
design/uart16550.sv
design/wb4_sram.sv
design/wb_addr_decoder.sv
design/wb_arbiter2.sv
